[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6420.87, "timestamp": "01:47:00", "text": "かなりの数だ。それは正義ですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6424.709, "timestamp": "01:47:04", "text": "それは単なる運搬作業ですか？それが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6430.39, "timestamp": "01:47:10", "text": "ああ、彼は死んだよ。ジャック、心配しないで。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6434.39, "timestamp": "01:47:14", "text": "あなたは安全です。何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6438.39, "timestamp": "01:47:18", "text": "ハルクが追いかけてきた。ありました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6440.229, "timestamp": "01:47:20", "text": "彼はそれを狙撃した。ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6444.31, "timestamp": "01:47:24", "text": "会員資格。しかし、それは歓迎すべきことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6446.629, "timestamp": "01:47:26", "text": "ああ、あれは戦車だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6449.91, "timestamp": "01:47:29", "text": "彼らは我々に戦車を落としている。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6471.43, "timestamp": "01:47:51", "text": "誰がやったんだ？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6472.653, "timestamp": "01:47:52", "author": "@ArusuAraeru", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dc2GWSBeOIoWoV_Yu1KJZ8Rd0EIvVX2NE8TZKOPigrbOXUH6MSPklyA0oUxTSJrKKkxsV3rdQA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/PVfsZ-7tIYCO_9EPt-GMgAw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6474.629, "timestamp": "01:47:54", "text": "警備員の派遣を要請します。"}]